    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, they most certainly do. And I guess from what you have found out as you continue to fill in the timeline, in fact, you just updated that most recently within the last few days. But as you hear more and more from these US Secret Service officials, the acting director, of course, the folks in the FBI who are supposed to be engaged and involved in a real investigation into finding out what happened. We know that this was an abject failure of mission, that we don't need an investigation to find out. That we need to know why, how this all happened. Are you feeling more and more that these government officials, these Biden administration officials are lying to you?",
