  {
    "episode_id": 46645,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/6/46645.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "I'm not the only person asking this question, and that's what you talked about at the outset of our conversation, that if you wanted to create a storm of conspiracy theories, you couldn't ask for a better way to do that than the failure of the Secret Service and federal agencies involved. to provide the public with the information that it truly needs. So here's the question. As you go about investigating this, do you have any concerns that this wasn't just a 21-year-old, 22-year-old kid who wanted to, for whatever reason, shoot the former president of the United States, hurt, kill the former president of the United States? Do you believe this was an inside job?",
