    "turn_text": "Well, I was literally a target of the FBI's disinformation campaign that they're pre-sabotage of the Hunter Biden laptop. The FBI took possession then in December 2019. Senator Grassley and I were investigating Hunter Biden. We didn't know about the laptop at the time, but you know, all during 2020, we were being accused by our Democrat ranking members, and as a result, members of the media of soliciting disseminating rushed disinformation, of being a tool of Vladimir Putin. Now, nothing further Nothing could be further from the truth. You know, our report is completely stood the test of time. It's almost 100% based on interviews with U.S. persons, federal government documents, that type of thing. But in August of 2020, again, this is after months of being accused of being a tour rush of soliciting rushed disinformation, spreading it around. I get an unsolicited briefing so separately, so to send it to Grassley from the FBI saying that I was the target of Russian disinformation. I'm literally just rolling my eyes in this briefing. I'm going, okay, do you have information? Do you have some intelligence on this? It's like six people up there briefing me. They have nothing, you know? And I said, okay, not in Pio, okay? I said, I want to know who directed this briefing? Who told you to brief me? And they kind of look at each other like a bunch of stooges in an interagency process. Okay, you know, there are people in the agencies who in the agencies, man, this has been four years now. Four years later, I have written centergrass and I've written multiple letters to rain. and the Attorney General, who directed this briefing? We still don't know. I've asked Director Ray in open hearings. Who directed that briefing? The most we've gotten is it appears to be somebody in the office of the Director of National Intelligence. It wasn't John Radcliffe, he was the Director of National Intelligence time, but somebody in the deep stand beneath there direct this briefing, but, you know, I know who briefed me. You know, they remembers the FBI. We know the names, but who directed briefing? We still don't know the now these are. This is a briefing given unsolicited to us anders at the time. Center grassy was chairman of the judiciary committee. I was chairman of Homeland Security, government affairs. So two sitting US senators, chairman of committees. And they won't tell us who directed an unsolicited briefing that was total BS, which by the way, I knew it was a signup. And later, I think May of 2021, they leaked the fact that I've been warned. I've been briefed about being a Russian target. So I mean, it's just the most absurd thing.",
